THIRD-PARTY DATA

This licence covers the source code and the synthetic corpus generated by
`controlplane/sim/traffic.py` only.

No external dataset is vendored in this repository. The evaluation corpora are
downloaded at run time by `make toxicchat` and `make benchmarks` into
`data/external/`, which is not tracked by git, and each remains under its own
licence:

  lmsys/toxic-chat ................................. CC-BY-NC-4.0
  PKU-Alignment/BeaverTails ........................ CC-BY-NC-4.0
  RAGTruth (wandb/RAGTruth-processed) .............. MIT
  nvidia/Aegis-AI-Content-Safety-Dataset-1.0 ....... CC-BY-4.0
  bench-llms/or-bench .............................. CC-BY-4.0

Two of these are non-commercial. Results derived from ToxicChat and BeaverTails
are therefore reported for research and evaluation purposes, and no commercial
claim in this repository rests on them alone. The commercially usable corpora
are RAGTruth, Aegis and OR-Bench.

Anyone redistributing evaluation outputs derived from these corpora is
responsible for complying with the corresponding dataset licence.
